The runtime uses FlashInfer and NVIDIA CUDA/TensorRT-LLM attention kernels.
Credit for native NVFP4 attention, quantization and speculative decoding
belongs to their respective upstream authors. This project integrates
those capabilities and adds the documented verification/prefill changes.

Model weights are NOT distributed or relicensed by this repository.
Download them from the pinned original repositories in runtime-manifest.json:
- Qwen team: Qwen3.8-27B base model.
- Huihui AI: abliterated source checkpoint.
- Gittensor Model Hub: RTX 5090 NVFP4 recipe/layout and LM head.
- heswithme: Huihui/Gittensor-style NVFP4 checkpoint quantization and packaging.
- NVIDIA: Model Optimizer.
- Inco AI and the DFlash authors: Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2 draft model.
